&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Driver Lead to join our team in New Jersey. This role oversees driver and vehicle readiness, supports route planning and fleet logistics, and steps in as a backup driver when needed — ensuring every shift runs safely, accurately, and on time.&lt;/p&gt;
