&lt;p&gt;Join the best last-mile distribution company with an unbeatable value proposition. If you&#39;re a proactive, detail-oriented leader with a last-mile focus and strong driving experience, this is your opportunity to lead a team and put that experience to work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What your shift will look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all drivers complete the pre-shift safety checklist and verify vehicles are in safe, working condition before departure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively monitor fleet maintenance needs, report vehicle issues, and coordinate routine service to minimize downtime&lt;/li&gt;
