&lt;p&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid Driver&#39;s License&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clean driving record / satisfactory MVR check required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ year of experience safely driving a delivery vehicle (e.g., 26&#39; box truck) in city environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No CDL required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating New Jersey and New York is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in last-mile delivery, logistics, or fleet operations is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership, organizational, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to lift and handle delivery supplies as needed&lt;/li&gt;
